  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fix release. img2img with very low --strength no longer crashes (always keeps at least one denoise step). Video frame-directory extraction samples file paths before reading, so maxFrames is respected without loading every frame into memory. The ffmpeg probe is killed on timeout instead of hanging. The stable-diffusion.cpp progress handler is registered once (no longer accumulates per call). FP8 dequantization handles tensors with 2^31+ elements.",
